      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "Twin_Towers",
      "label": "World Trade Center Twin Towers",
      "description": "The original Twin Towers were the two main skyscrapers of the World Trade Center complex in Lower Manhattan, New York City. They were iconic symbols of global commerce and American economic power. Their destruction during the 9/11 attacks was a defining moment in modern history and had profound global repercussions.",
