      "instance_name": "grief",
      "label": "grief emotion",
      "description": "The image depicts a catastrophic event with smoke billowing from the World Trade Center tower, evoking a profound sense of loss and sorrow associated with the 9/11 attacks. The visual of destruction and the textual description of a 'fiery blast' after being hit by planes amplify the emotional weight of human tragedy and collective mourning.",
